.TH i.ortho.target 1 "" "GRASS 8.4.1" "GRASS GIS User's Manual"
.SH NAME
\fI\fBi.ortho.target\fR\fR  \- Select or modify the imagery group target.
.SH KEYWORDS
imagery, orthorectify
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBi.ortho.target\fR
.br
\fBi.ortho.target \-\-help\fR
.br
\fBi.ortho.target\fR \fBgroup\fR=\fIname\fR \fBtarget_project\fR=\fIname\fR \fBtarget_mapset\fR=\fIname\fR  [\-\-\fBhelp\fR]  [\-\-\fBverbose\fR]  [\-\-\fBquiet\fR]  [\-\-\fBui\fR]
.SS Flags:
.IP "\fB\-\-help\fR" 4m
.br
Print usage summary
.IP "\fB\-\-verbose\fR" 4m
.br
Verbose module output
.IP "\fB\-\-quiet\fR" 4m
.br
Quiet module output
.IP "\fB\-\-ui\fR" 4m
.br
Force launching GUI dialog
.SS Parameters:
.IP "\fBgroup\fR=\fIname\fR \fB[required]\fR" 4m
.br
Name of imagery group for ortho\-rectification
.IP "\fBtarget_project\fR=\fIname\fR \fB[required]\fR" 4m
.br
Project (location) name
.br
Name of target project (location) for ortho\-rectification
.IP "\fBtarget_mapset\fR=\fIname\fR \fB[required]\fR" 4m
.br
Name of mapset (default: current search path)
.br
Name of target mapset for ortho\-rectification
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fIi.ortho.target\fR sets the image group target project (location) and mapset.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fI
i.ortho.photo,
i.ortho.elev,
i.ortho.camera,
g.gui.photo2image,
g.gui.image2target,
i.ortho.init,
i.ortho.rectify
\fR
